<title>USA: Plymouth Rubber can't explain shr decline.</title>
<headline>Plymouth Rubber can't explain shr decline.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plymouth Rubber Co Inc said on Thursday that it cannot explain why the company's share price dropped today, since there is no significant fundamental change in the company or its finances.</p>
<p>Plymouth Rubber's class A shares fell 13/16 to 5-1/4, while the B shares dropped 1-1/4 to 4-1/2.</p>
